{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14146","headline":"辰州建中四年多怀 · 戎昱","name":"辰州建中四年多怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒徼辰阳远，穷秋瘴雨深。\n主恩堪洒血，边宦更何心。\n海上红旗满，生前白发侵。\n竹寒宁改节，隼静早因禽。\n务退门多掩，愁来酒独斟。\n天涯忧国泪，无日不沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}